- sig ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ᐅ k:ℕ ⊦ plusAssoc ≔ ℕ-elim Refl (i ih. Refl) k : plus[] (plus[] n m) k ≡ plus[] n (plus[] m k) ∈ ℕ
- sub-norm-term ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ᐅ k:ℕ ⊦
- sub-norm-ext ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ᐅ k:ℕ ⊦ n to ε ᐅ n:ℕ
- sub-norm-ext ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ᐅ k:ℕ ⊦ n, m to ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ
- sub-norm-ext ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ᐅ k:ℕ ⊦ n, m, k to ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ᐅ k:ℕ
- sig-var ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ᐅ k:ℕ ⊦ plusAssoc[n, m, k]
